    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REA Stokes and Quirke are delighted to bring to the market this well-maintained extended three-bedroom terraced residence situated in the popular village of Ardfinnan. The property is presented in excellent decorative order throughout. Accommodation includes three bedrooms with the added benefit of a floored attic space. It has the benefit of a dual heating system and an enclosed maintenance free rear garden with vehicular access and sheds. The property enjoys outstanding views of the surrounding countryside and mountain landscape. Viewing strictly by prior appointment. \n\nAccommodation\n\nHallway\n Tiled floor, with wainscotting on wall. Exposed timber staircase with storage underneath\n\nSitting Room\n3.30m x 4.20m Facing green area to front with laminate floor, free standing solid fuel stove with stone effect surround. dual purpose heating system oil and solid fuel. Built in book case. Wainscotting on walls.\n\nKitchen/Dining Area\n2.70m x 5.40m open plan- dining area has tiled floor, built in cupboard\n\nKitchen\n3.00m x 3.30m Tiled floor, large breakfast bar with integrated electric oven and extractor. Built in units at eye and floor level with tiled splashback, plumbed for dishwasher, large window overlooking large maintenance free garden with vehicular access to rear. Door to,\n\nUtility Room\n1.40m x 1.60m Plumbed for washing machine, built in units, tiled floor, door to,\n\nDownstairs Bathroom\n1.87m x 1.50m Tiled floor, Wc, whb, Mira electric shower , wainscotting on wall\n\nLanding\n Carpeted staircase and landing\n\nBedroom 1\n2.70m x 4.30m Laminate floor, built in wardrobe. Overlooking green area and the mountains.\n\nBedroom 2\n3.80m x 2.80m Laminate floor, built in wardrobe, large window overlooking front\n\nBedroom 3\n3.00m x 2.40m bedroom/office- laminate floor, window facing rear. Door to ; bathroom 3.7m x 1.5m with laminate floor, bath, wc, whb\n\nAttic Space\n3.80m x 3.00m Staircase to large floored attic with laminate floor and large double window overlooking rear garden and surrounding countryside\n\n\nOutside\nTarmac driveway to front. Vehicular access to rear Array of useful sheds to rear : Shed 1- 3.6m x 3.7m Shed 2- 3m x 2.5m"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "3 bed extended residence in excellent decorative order \nPVC windows\nNicely presented garden with Pergola off the kitchen \n \n Dual heating system of oil and solid fuel \nMains sewage\nExcellent broadband availability \n Ardfinnan offers a range of local amenities including shops, primary school, church, GAA facilities and scenic riverside walks, with a wider range of services available in nearby Clonmel and Cahir."
      },
